      "name": "What is the CRM Jason Obawemimo built for Triple J?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Jason Obawemimo built Triple J Auto Investment's custom dealership CRM (Handle a Sale) with TypeScript, React and Next.js, SQL (PostgreSQL), Supabase, Vercel and Edge Functions. He designed its lead-to-title data model, roles and validation, tested Supabase row-level security (RLS) policies to prevent unauthorized role access, and added validation that prevents invalid deal and inventory records from being written. He executed production schema migrations while preserving existing records and operational tables, and shipped it on Vercel with Edge Functions for voice and texting webhooks. It is used daily by three staff across inventory, deals and follow-up."
      }
    },
    {
